SUMMARY:Blind Tennis
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Blind Tennis\, in our Activity Center! \nThis is a great opportunity for blind and visually impaired adults to learn about and experience blind tennis in a fun\, welcoming environment. \n  \nREGISTER HERE.
