SUMMARY:Monthly Tandem Bike Riding with Achilles International - August 2026
DESCRIPTION:Ride in Tandem – Inclusive Cycling with The Lighthouse and Achilles International\nDon’t miss the thrill of our upcoming tandem bike ride days! In partnership with Achilles International\, we’re bringing together riders of all abilities for a fully inclusive tandem cycling workout\, followed by a relaxed breakfast social to refuel and connect. \nWhere: Stude Park – 1031 Stude Street\, Houston\, TX 77007 \nWhen: Usually every Saturday of the month\, 8:00–10:00 AM. Check our events calendar for exact dates. \nPLEASE NOTE: If you are already an Achilles member\, please register by Friday at 8:00 AM. If you are not yet an Achilles member\, please complete their free membership form here: https://achillesinternational.rosterfy.com/register \nFor questions regarding tandem rides\, please contact Michaela with Achilles Houston at 346-819-7465. \nWant to make an even bigger impact? Volunteers are needed to help guide riders\, assist with equipment\, and keep the event running smoothly. Whether you’re an experienced cyclist or just eager to lend a hand\, your support helps ensure a safe\, fun\, and welcoming experience for all participants. \nFor more details or to volunteer\, call 713-284-8424\, email youthadultservices@houstonlighthouse.org\, or visit the Achilles International Houston website. \nREGISTER HERE. \n 
URL:https://houstonlighthouse.org/event/monthly-tandem-bike-riding-with-achilles-international-august-2026/2026-08-15/
LOCATION:Stude Park\, 1031 Stude Street\, Houston\, TX\, 77007
CATEGORIES:Adult Events,Community Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://eadn-wc02-10923896.nxedge.io/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/Tandem-Bikes.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Achilles International":MAILTO:mcueto@achillesinternational.org.
GEO:29.7793129;-95.3862936
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Stude Park 1031 Stude Street Houston TX 77007;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=1031 Stude Street:geo:-95.3862936,29.7793129
END:VEVENT
