SUMMARY:BVI Back to School Resource Fair 2026
DESCRIPTION:Join us at The Lighthouse of Houston on August 15 from 9:00 AM to 12:30 PM for our 2026 Transition and Resource Fair—a dynamic\, hands-on event designed for blind and visually impaired youth ages 14–22. This exciting fair empowers students with essential life skills including self-advocacy\, confidence building\, job readiness\, and computer literacy. Attendees will explore adaptive technology\, orientation and mobility training\, and even get creative with accessible arts and crafts. The event also features a wide range of community and government resources—all at no cost. Plus\, students will receive free BVI accessible school supplies and a backpack! We are grateful to our amazing sponsors who help make this impactful event possible. \nStudents – Click here to register. \nVendors – Click here to register. \n 
URL:https://houstonlighthouse.org/event/bvi-back-to-school-resource-fair-2026/
LOCATION:The Lighthouse of Houston\, 3602 West Dallas\, Houston\, TX\, 77019\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community Events,Health Services,Youth Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://eadn-wc02-10923896.nxedge.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/BVI-Fair-2026.png
GEO:29.7578318;-95.4071468
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The Lighthouse of Houston 3602 West Dallas Houston TX 77019 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=3602 West Dallas:geo:-95.4071468,29.7578318
END:VEVENT
