SUMMARY:Community Shredding Day
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Community Shredding Day! At 2501 Central Parkway\, Suite A4. \nGet your items safely and professionally destroyed by our team\, for only .86 cents per pound. \nItems we shred include binders & banker’s boxes\, removable media\, textiles\, and plastics & wood.
URL:https://houstonlighthouse.org/event/community-shredding-day/2026-08-15/
LOCATION:2501 Central Parkway\, Suite A4\, 2501 Central Parkway\, Suite A4\, Houston\, TX\, United States
