SUMMARY:The Lighthouse Peer Support Group - Monthly
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a new monthly in-person education and support group for individuals who are blind or have low vision. This social and informative gathering takes place every 3rd Tuesday of the month and offers a welcoming space to connect\, share experiences\, and learn about local resources available to the blind and low vision (BLV) community. \nWhether you’re seeking helpful information\, looking to build friendships\, or want to share your own experiences\, this group is here to support and empower you. \nTime: 10:00 AM – 11:30 AM\nLocation: The Lighthouse of Houston Boardroom \nAll are welcome. Come join the conversation and help grow a strong\, connected BLV community.
URL:https://houstonlighthouse.org/event/the-lighthouse-peer-support-group/2026-08-18/
LOCATION:The Lighthouse of Houston\, 3602 West Dallas\, Houston\, TX\, 77019\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://eadn-wc02-10923896.nxedge.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/The-Lighthouse-Peer-Support-Group-2025-1.png
GEO:29.7578318;-95.4071468
