DESCRIPTION:This class is designed to increase a beginner’s confidence in the use of Microsoft Office Suite including\, word\, excel\, outlook\, other Microsoft Office apps and programs\, while using JAWS screen reader. You will learn key functions of each program\, JAWS shortcut commands\, and other tools and tips that will enhance your Microsoft Office Suite knowledge to help ensure your computer interaction is less stress and ready for success! \nPlease note\, a basic level of knowledge of JAWS is required to take this class. We offer training classes on JAWS; please contact us for more information. \nRegister Online\n\n                \n                        \n                            Microsoft Office Class Registration\n							"*" indicates required fields \n                        					\n						Δ\n						\n						\n\n					\n                        InstagramThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.Name*\n                            \n                            \n                                                    First\n                                                    \n                                                \n                            \n                            \n                                                            Last\n                                                            \n                                                        \n                            \n                        Email*\n                            \n                        PhoneLevel of experience with MicrosoftLevel of experience with JAWSAnything in particular you are looking to learn\, questions\, commentsAddress*    \n                    \n                         \n                                        Street Address\n                                        \n                                   \n                                    City\n                                    \n                                 \n             