UID:10009619-1789131600-1789140600@houstonlighthouse.org
SUMMARY:The Lighthouse Open House 2026
DESCRIPTION:Join Us at The Lighthouse Open House 2026 for People who are Blind\, Low Vision\, or have a Disability! \nDate & Time:Friday\, September 11\, 20261 – 3:30 PM \nLocation:The Lighthouse of Houston3602 West Dallas St\, Houston\, TX 77019 \nEvent Description:Join us for the inaugural Lighthouse Open House 2026\, a dynamic and inclusive event designed for people who are blind\, have low vision\, or live with a disability. This one-day event will feature hands-on experiences\, valuable resources\, and community connection opportunities all under one roof. \nEvent Highlights:Employment \n\nResume-building workshops and interview prep\nMeet-and-greet with inclusive employers\nTips for navigating the workplace with vision loss\n\nTechnology \n\nHands-on demonstrations of assistive technology and low vision devices\nTutorials on screen readers\, magnifiers\, and accessible apps\nTry-before-you-buy opportunities with top vendors\n\nHealth & Community Resources \n\nFree health screenings (blood pressure\, glucose\, and more)\nBehavioral health and wellness sessions\nDiabetes education and vision-specific health tips\nInformation on transportation\, housing\, and benefits assistance\nAccess to local nonprofits\, support organizations\, and accessible recreation\n\nWhether you’re seeking tools for independence\, looking to connect with community services\, or exploring inclusive employment\, this expo is for you. \nClick Here for Attendee Registration. \nClick Here for Vendor Registration.
URL:https://houstonlighthouse.org/event/the-lighthouse-expo-2026/
LOCATION:The Lighthouse of Houston\, 3602 West Dallas\, Houston\, TX\, 77019\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://eadn-wc02-10923896.nxedge.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Lighthouse-Open-House-2026.png
GEO:29.7578318;-95.4071468
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The Lighthouse of Houston 3602 West Dallas Houston TX 77019 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=3602 West Dallas:geo:-95.4071468,29.7578318
END:VEVENT
