SUMMARY:Monthly SINGO Bingo 2026 - September
DESCRIPTION:Turn the volume up and the worries down—SINGO Bingo is back\, and it’s here to play louder than ordinary bingo ever could. \nThis monthly favorite blends the joy of music with the thrill of the game. Songs replace numbers\, laughter replaces silence\, and every round becomes a shared rhythm of anticipation. Designed with accessibility at the center\, SINGO Bingo features Braille and large-print cards so participants who are blind or low vision can play fully\, confidently\, and independently. \nFree and open to the community\, this is a night to unwind\, connect\, and let the music carry you. No pressure. No experience required. Just good company\, great sound\, and a little luck along the way. \nSpots fill quickly—register online and claim your seat at the table. \n\n                \n                        \n							"*" indicates required fields \n                        					\n						Δ\n						\n						\n\n					\n                        EmailThis field is for validation purposes and should be left unchanged.Name*\n                            \n                            \n                                                    First\n                                                    \n                                                \n                            \n                            \n                                                            Last\n                                                            \n                                                        \n                            \n                        Email*\n                            \n                        PhoneAddress    \n                    \n                         \n                                        Street Address\n                                        \n                                   \n                                    City\n                                    \n                                 \n                                        State\n         