SUMMARY:Monthly Lighthouse Book Club
DESCRIPTION:Lighthouse Book Club \nThe Lighthouse Book Club is launching—a new monthly gathering for readers who love stories\, conversation\, and shared perspective. \nJoin us on the second to last Thursday of each month from 4:00–5:00 PM in the Boardroom of Building 1\, for an engaging discussion led by Fernando Espinoza\, who will host the club. \nAt each meeting\, Book Club members will collectively choose the next month’s book\, ensuring a rotating\, member-driven reading list. To join the GroupMe chat\, please click here. \nIf you are in need of help to set up audio books on your phone\, assistance is available. You may email Fernando Espinoza at fespinoza@houstonlighthouse.org for more information \nSIGN UP HERE
URL:https://houstonlighthouse.org/event/lighthouse_book_club/2026-09-17/
LOCATION:The Lighthouse of Houston\, 3602 West Dallas\, Houston\, TX\, 77019\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://eadn-wc02-10923896.nxedge.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Lighthouse-Book-Club.png
