SUMMARY:Monthly Tandem Bike Riding with Achilles International - October 2026
DESCRIPTION:Ride in Tandem – Inclusive Cycling with The Lighthouse and Achilles International\nDon’t miss the thrill of our upcoming tandem bike ride days! In partnership with Achilles International\, we’re bringing together riders of all abilities for a fully inclusive tandem cycling workout\, followed by a relaxed breakfast social to refuel and connect. \nWhere: Stude Park – 1031 Stude Street\, Houston\, TX 77007 \nWhen: Usually the first Saturday of every month\, 8:00–10:00 AM. Check our events calendar for exact dates. \nPLEASE NOTE: Attendees must register by 8:00 AM the Friday before each bike ride. Contact Michaela for more information. \nWant to make an even bigger impact? Volunteers are needed to help guide riders\, assist with equipment\, and keep the event running smoothly. Whether you’re an experienced cyclist or just eager to lend a hand\, your support helps ensure a safe\, fun\, and welcoming experience for all participants. \nFor more details or to volunteer\, call 713-284-8424\, email youthadultservices@houstonlighthouse.org\, or visit the Achilles International Houston website. \n 
URL:https://houstonlighthouse.org/event/monthly-tandem-bike-riding-with-achilles-international-october-2026/
